<title>USA: Telecomm buys Northeastern Communications.</title>
<headline>Telecomm buys Northeastern Communications.</headline>
<dateline>MENTOR, Ohio 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecomm Industries Inc said it had a definitive purchase agreement to buy the assets and business of Northeastern Communication Systems Inc for $650,000 cash and 400,000 restricted common shares of stock.</p>
<p>Telecomm, said the acquisition will add more than $2.5 million in annual sales and give the company a strong presence in Wisconsin.</p>
<p>Both companies are Ameritech Corp voice and data distributors.</p>
</text>
